  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Match List-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mfenced></math> with List-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>II</mi></mfenced></math>.</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>List-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mfenced></math></td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>List-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>II</mi></mfenced></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>a</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></msub></math>&nbsp;(Rydberg constant)</td>\t\t\t<td>i</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>kg</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>b</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi></math>&nbsp;(Planck&#39;s constant)</td>\t\t\t<td>ii</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>kg</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>c</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub></math> (Magnetic field energy density)</td>\t\t\t<td>iii</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>d</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#951;</mi></math> (coefficient of viscosity)</td>\t\t\t<td>iv</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>kg</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mtext>m</mtext><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the most appropriate answer from the options given below:</p>"
  },
